day 2024.15

# A robot pushes boxes (O) around a warehouse; walls (#) don't move. A move
# that would push a box into a wall does nothing.
# Part 1: the sum of the boxes' GPS coordinates (100 * y + x) at the end.
# Part 2: the same, in a warehouse twice as wide, where each box is two
#         cells wide and can push two boxes at once.

example """
##########
#..O..O.O#
#......O.#
#.OO..O.O#
#..O@..O.#
#O#..O...#
#O..O..O.#
#.OO.O.OO#
#....O...#
##########

